{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ深川さんとご飯へ\n行ってきました！\n2人では1年ぶりとか(o_o)！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたら4時間話し続け、\n4時間食べ続け、\n出る頃には満腹ちゃんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにたくさんお話し出来て\n楽しかった〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きましょう〜〜♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3/27〜原宿にOPENしていた\n乃木坂カフェですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/10に無事閉店しました〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のカフェにはたくさんの方が\n協力してくれて、\nみなさんのおかげで\n完走することが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びに来てくれた方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定とわかっていながらも、\nいざ終わってしまうと寂しいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみバイトたくさん入ってくれて\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の何空カフェの時から\nバイトしたい！って言ってくれていて\n嬉しかったよ！\n実現出来て良かった♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーもたくさん来てくれて\n目標だった半数なんて\nゆうに越えて30人弱のメンバーが\n来てくれましたV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しいのにありがとうございますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n最終日にはカフェのスタッフさんから\nお花も頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カフェに来るファンの方が\n気持ちよくカフェを利用出来たのも\nスタッフさんのおかげです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のシングルではやるかわからないし、\n次なんてあるのかさえわかりません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもまたマネージャーを\nやらせて頂けるかもわからない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこの充実した45日間に\n後悔はありません。\nやれて良かったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら\n是非遊びに来て下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/17/7376119/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/15 EX大衆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんカフェについて\n取材して頂きました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週水曜 深夜0時〜\nまいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ